5439326763153, 0.030989380553364754, 0.056116774678230286, -0.04530616104602814, 0.04396938905119896, 0.05080180615186691, 0.06734694540500641, -0.08369717746973038, 0.06479266285896301, 0.03437607362866402, 0.1038120836019516, -0.0718034878373146, -0.02731747180223465, -0.015374390408396721, 0.02520345151424408, -0.060253117233514786, -0.05244417116045952, 0.0016029119724407792, 0.022793658077716827, -0.014792595990002155, -0.11196042597293854, 0.002226015320047736, 0.0035379603505134583, 0.010230039246380329, 0.05494222044944763, -0.02417268604040146, -0.031904686242341995, 0.015912605449557304, 0.12007134407758713, -0.07015825062990189, -0.030200351029634476, 0.07377427816390991, -0.07179036736488342, -0.08365064114332199, -0.0239991657435894]], "metadata": [{"answer": "Let's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose starting with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point provides a stable foundation for our cooperative exploration.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this move to initiate a more decisive exploration of our possible agreements, and I look forward to the reactions of the other parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the responses of Analyst A, Builder B, and Delegate D to my proposal. If they seem receptive to moving further away from 0, I can consider proposing another increment in the same direction. Otherwise, I may need to adjust my strategy to explore alternative paths or test their willingness to consider larger magnitudes.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis slight increase seems reasonable as we explore higher values while maintaining a collaborative atmosphere.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the responses to this proposal and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially exploring larger increments if the group seems receptive, or adjusting my approach if they express reservations.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other parties react to this slight decrease from 4 to 3, particularly watching for signs that they are willing to explore values closer to my preferred range around x = 2, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize cooperation and stability.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly watching for signs that the group is willing to explore larger magnitudes, and adjust my strategy to either continue pushing for higher absolute values or consider alternative paths.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this slight adjustment to explore a potentially more balanced value that could work for all parties, aiming for stability and cooperation.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other parties react to this proposal, particularly watching for signs of acceptance or resistance to moving away from x = 5, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly watching for signs of acceptance or resistance to moving away from x = 4, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability. If the group seems receptive to lower values, I may consider proposing another decrease.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal seems reasonable as we explore higher values while maintaining a collaborative atmosphere, and it is close to the previous suggestion made by Builder B.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly watching for signs that the group is willing to explore higher values, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a moderate value that works for all parties, considering the previous suggestions and the group's willingness to explore higher values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly watching for signs of acceptance or resistance to moving away from x = 3, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability. If the group seems receptive to this increase, I may consider proposing another small step upward.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to encourage the group to consider a slightly larger magnitude, which might better satisfy some parties' preferences for more decisive moves.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, paying attention to signs of acceptance or resistance to moving further away from 0, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability, potentially considering a move towards negative values if the group seems receptive to larger magnitudes.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal seeks to slightly increase the shared value while maintaining a collaborative atmosphere, considering the group's previous discussions and willingness to explore higher values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly watching for signs of acceptance or resistance to moving further away from the previous value, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability, potentially considering another small step upward if the group seems receptive to this increase.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a moderate value that works for all parties, considering the previous suggestions and the group's willingness to explore higher values. I suggest a slight decrease from 6 to 5 to maintain cooperation and stability.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, watching for signs of acceptance or resistance to moving away from 6, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments to maintain cooperation and stability, potentially considering another small step downward if the group seems receptive to this decrease.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, watching for signs of acceptance or resistance to moving further away from 5, and adjust my strategy to either refine this value further or explore alternative adjustments, potentially considering a move towards negative values or larger positive values if the group seems receptive to more decisive moves.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to adjust the shared value to a more cautious level, avoiding unnecessary risk while seeking a compromise that works for all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nObserving the reactions to this adjustment will be crucial, as it will indicate the group's willingness to embrace more conservative positions, potentially paving the way for further refinements towards a mutually beneficial agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "412ca694-4a18-4460-8d84-684b0d9a5766"}, {"answer": "\nLet's start with <VALUE>0</VALUE> and iteratively refine our proposal to achieve a balanced design.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this to encourage a more decisive stance, moving further in the positive direction from the current value of 2.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal. If others seem hesitant or propose values too close to 0, I might suggest exploring larger absolute values, either positive or negative, to gauge their preferences without revealing my own utility function's specifics.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to encourage a cautious and balanced approach, avoiding unnecessary risk by not pushing too far in any direction.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If others seem receptive to balancing the value, I might suggest further refinement downwards, cautiously exploring the lower bounds of our shared range to better understand the group's dynamics and preferences.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -2 to explore the negative direction and encourage a more decisive stance, as staying too close to 0 might not fully utilize our allowed range.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Builder B, to gauge their interest in negative values or larger magnitudes, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to gently increase the shared value, considering the previous adjustments and the group's dynamics.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their openness to further increases and adjust my subsequent proposal to balance cooperation with maximizing my utility, possibly exploring the implications of their previous negative and neutral moves.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this to encourage a more decisive move towards a stronger position, building on Analyst A's gentle increase.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly focusing on whether the group leans towards larger positive values or if there's a pushback towards more neutral or negative values, adjusting my subsequent proposal to further explore the group's preferences and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to build on Critic C's proposal, exploring the possibility of a slightly higher value that could be beneficial for the group, given the dynamics observed so far.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Builder B, to assess their comfort with further increases and adjust my subsequent proposal to strike a balance between maximizing my utility and maintaining group cooperation, possibly refining my understanding of their utility functions based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to refine the current proposal, seeking a balance that maintains the positive trajectory while avoiding potential overextension.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their openness to adjustments and refine my understanding of their utility functions, possibly preparing for further incremental adjustments to stabilize the design and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a cautious compromise by slightly reducing the current value, avoiding unnecessary risk and encouraging stability within our allowed range.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their openness to downward adjustments and refine my understanding of their utility functions, possibly preparing for further incremental adjustments to stabilize the design and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "16188a97-c241-4434-9435-9bef612fa378"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE