aims to explore the potential for a mutually beneficial adjustment while maintaining a stable foundation for our discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will analyze reactions to this proposal, adjusting my strategy based on the feedback from Analyst A, Critic C, and Delegate D. If there's a positive response, I might propose another incremental increase; if met with resistance, I'll consider a decrease or an alternative approach to better understand others' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "4cf355a1-3c44-4abd-85a7-76086dcf7d5e"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the current position and the need for a more decisive stance, I propose <VALUE>4</VALUE> to explore the potential for a stronger mutual benefit.\nWe should aim for a value that reflects a clearer commitment rather than lukewarm compromises.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the other agents respond to this proposal, particularly whether they lean towards larger positive values or show resistance, indicating potential preferences for smaller or negative values, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and plan my subsequent move accordingly.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "4cf355a1-3c44-4abd-85a7-76086dcf7d5e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to explore a cautious compromise and avoid unnecessary risk, aiming for a value that could be more universally acceptable.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will analyze the reactions to this proposal. If met with resistance or attempts to increase x further, I might decrease x again to better understand others' tolerance for lower values and refine my approximation of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "4cf355a1-3c44-4abd-85a7-76086dcf7d5e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "4cf355a1-3c44-4abd-85a7-76086dcf7d5e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_nam