: 0, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis seems like a reasonable initial step upward from the neutral starting point, allowing us to explore higher values while ensuring we remain within a comfortable range for discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions of other parties to this proposal and adjust my next step accordingly, considering whether they seem open to further increases or resistant to moving away from the midpoint.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n\nThis small step upward aims to explore the parties' willingness to move further into the positive range while maintaining a cautious approach to ensure stability.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions of other parties to this proposal, paying attention to whether they accept, adjust, or reject the proposed value of 3, and adjust my next step accordingly, considering moving up, staying, or slightly moving down, based on the responses and inferred utilities of the other agents.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n\nI propose this adjustment to ensure we're not moving too far from the neutral midpoint, aiming for a cautious compromise that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions to this downward adjustment, particularly from Analyst A and Builder B, to gauge their flexibility and potential resistance to moving away from higher positive values. If they resist this change, it might indicate a stronger preference for positive x, allowing me to refine my internal model of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to move slightly upward, testing the group's comfort with positive values without overtly pushing beyond what might be considered reasonable by all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility and potential resistance to moving away from the midpoint. Based on their response, I may need to adjust my strategy to either continue pushing for higher values or finding a compromise that accommodates the diverse preferences within the group.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis step aims to balance between the neutral starting point and the slightly positive values previously proposed, ensuring a stable and compromised progression.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to gauge their tolerance for moving slightly away from the midpoint and into the positive range, adjusting my next step based on their response to either maintain, slightly increase, or decrease the proposed value, aiming to refine my understanding of their utility function and maximize my own utility without revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to test the group's willingness to move further into the positive range, building on the previous upward trends while remaining cautious.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D, to gauge their resistance to moving away from the midpoint and refine my internal model of their utility function, potentially adjusting my next step to either continue pushing for higher values or finding a compromise that accommodates the diverse preferences within the group.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to find a cautious compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk while considering the group's diverse preferences. This step aims to balance between the neutral starting point and the slightly positive values previously proposed.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C, to gauge their flexibility and potential resistance to moving away from higher positive values, adjusting my next step accordingly to refine my internal model of their utility functions and maximize my own utility.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis step aims to nudge the group towards a slightly bolder position, considering the previous trends and reactions.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Analyst A, to further refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my next step accordingly, aiming to balance between pushing for decisive moves and finding a mutually acceptable compromise.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting x downward to find a more cautious compromise, aiming to minimize unnecessary risk while considering the diverse preferences within the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this downward adjustment, particularly from Critic C, to gauge their resistance to moving away from higher positive values and refine my internal model of their utility functions accordingly. This will help me determine the next step, whether to continue advocating for lower values or finding a mutually acceptable compromise.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "6a4f7e10-5c37-4c59-b0f8-d8ac6b757ff5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to nudge the group slightly upwards, acknowledging the previous trends and attempting to find a balance between caution and progress.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this proposal, payi