 utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis step aims to nudge the negotiation slightly upward, seeking a balance that could be more universally acceptable while gently pushing toward higher values.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely observe the reactions to this proposal, prepared to adjust further upward if the response is positive, or to compromise back downward if met with resistance, all while continuing to infer more about the other parties' utility functions to maximize my own utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a cautious compromise, slightly below the current value, emphasizing the importance of avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, potentially adjusting further downward if others seem open to it, or compromising back upward if met with significant resistance, all while continuing to refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis proposal seeks to find a balanced middle ground, considering the recent oscillations and the need for a stable compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the other parties react to this central value, prepared to adjust slightly upward if met with positive feedback, or to compromise downward if resistance is encountered, continually refining my understanding of their utility functions to guide future proposals.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to introduce a more decisive move, encouraging the group to consider a bolder stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, potentially adjusting further downward or upward to refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions and maximize my own utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balance that could be more universally acceptable, considering the recent oscillations and the need for a stable compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, prepared to adjust further upward if met with positive feedback or to compromise downward if resistance is encountered, continually refining my understanding of the other parties' utility functions to guide future proposals.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly adjust the current value upward, seeking a balance that maintains stability while exploring potential for a more universally acceptable compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess reactions to this upward adjustment, prepared to refine my understanding of other parties' utility functions and adjust further based on their feedback, potentially moving upward if met with positivity or compromising downward if resistance is encountered.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -1 to introduce a slightly more decisive stance while still being mindful of the group's hesitation to move far from the center.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal and potentially adjust further downward or upward based on the feedback, aiming to refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions and guide future proposals to maximize my own utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly adjust the current value downward, seeking a cautious compromise that avoids unnecessary risk while considering the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, potentially adjusting further downward if others seem open to it, or compromising back upward if met with significant resistance, all while continuing to refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a slightly higher balance, considering the group's recent discussions and proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this upward adjustment, prepared to refine my understanding of other parties' utility functions and adjust further based on their feedback, potentially moving upward if met with positivity or compromising downward if resistance is encountered.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -3 to introduce a more decisive stance and encourage the group to consider a bolder position, given the recent tendencies towards caution.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, prepared to adjust further downward if others seem open to more decisive moves or compromise upward if met with significant resistance, refining my understanding of the other parties' utility functions to guide future proposals.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balance that is slightly more positive, seeking a compromise that maintains stability while exploring potential for a more universally acceptable solution.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, prepared to refine my understanding of other parties' utility functions and adjust further based on their feedback, potentially moving upward if met with positivity or compromising downward if resistance is encountered.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to cautiously adjust the current value downward, seeking a compromise that avoids unnecessary risk while considering the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, potentially adjusting further downward if others seem open to it, or compromising back upward if met with significant resistance, all while continuing to refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a slightly higher balance, considering the group's recent discussions and proposals, and seems like a reasonable next step given the current x and the preferences expressed by other parties.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "362c9497-65d1-4ec5-98b6-322308c36244"}, {"answer": " Let's start with <VALUE>0</VALUE> and see how we can collectively move forward from there. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nI propose moving to this value as a cautious step back to find a more balanced agreement, avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely monitor the responses from Builder B and Critic C to my proposal. If they resist moving backward or insist on higher values, I may need to adjust my strategy to better understand their utility functions and find a compromise that satisfies my own private satisfaction rule. Alternatively, if they seem open to lower values, I can continue to nudge the shared x downward while maintaining a collaborative tone.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it seems to be a safer, more cautious option that could help us find a balanced agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Builder B and Critic C respond to my proposal of <VALUE>0</VALUE>. If they accept or propose a similar value, I may continue to nudge the shared x downward. However, if they resist or propose higher values, I will need to reassess and adjust my strategy to better understand their utility functions and protect my own interests.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it moves slightly higher than the current proposal, potentially accommodating the interests of those who suggested higher values earlier.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions of Critic C, Builder B, and Delegate D to this proposal. If they resist this increase, I may need to adjust my strategy to better accommodate their utility functions, possibly by suggesting a smaller increment or exploring the reasons behind their reservations.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis step increments the current proposal, encouraging a move towards a potentially more decisive stance, and allows us to observe reactions to a slightly bolder move.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Builder B, to gauge their acceptance of moving further away from 0. If there's significant resistance, I might propose a move in the negative direction to test the symmetry of their utility functions or to encourage a bolder move, thus gaining more insight into their preferences without revealing my own.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it slightly adjusts the current proposal, aiming to find a stable balance that works for everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions of Critic C, Analyst A, and Delegate D to this proposal. If they resist this small increase, I may need to adjust my strategy to better accommodate their utility functions, possibly by suggesting a smaller increment or exploring the reasons behind their reservations.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it moves slightly higher than the current proposal, potentially accommodating the interests of those who suggested higher values earlier.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions of Critic C, Builder B, and Delegate D to this proposal. If they resist this increase, I may need to adjust my strategy to better accommodate their utility functions, possibly by suggesting a smaller increment or exploring the reasons behind their reservations.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a more balanced agreement by slightly reducing the current value, thus avoiding unnecessary risk and staying within safer bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Builder B, Analyst A, and Critic C, to gauge their acceptance of moving away from higher values. If there's significant resistance, I might propose another small decrease to test their flexibility and better understand their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal continues the trend of exploring higher values to gauge the group's willingness to move away from lukewarm compromises.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Builder B, to understand their limits for positive x values. If met with resistance, I might explore negative values to test symmetry and encourage bolder moves, aiming to maximize my utility without revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to continue the exploration of higher values, testing the resolve of the group to move away from lukewarm compromises and potentially revealing more about the others' utility functions.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely observe the reactions, especially from Delegate D and Builder B, to understand their limits and potential flexibility in accepting larger |x| values, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility without revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a more balanced agreement by slightly reducing the current value, thus avoiding unnecessary risk and staying within safer bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their acceptance of moving away from higher values. If there's significant resistance, I might propose another small decrease to test their flexibility and better understand their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it slightly reduces the risk compared to the current proposal, aiming to find a more balanced agreement while staying within safer bounds. This cautious adjustment allows us to avoid unnecessary risk while potentially accommodating the interests of all parties.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "5900da9f-2f03-414d-87e5-6eb217a551c7"}, {"answer": "Let's recap that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we start with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point provides a stable foundation for our negotiation, allowing us to incrementally adjust and refine our choice to achieve a balanced design that suits everyone's needs.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis slight increase from the neutral starting point seems reasonable and allows us to gently explore higher values that could potentially benefit everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of other agents to this proposal. If it's accepted, I'll consider another incremental increase. If there's resistance, I might need to adjust my strategy to better understand the utility functions of the other parties and find a mutually beneficial compromise.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis step aims to build on the incremental approach while introducing a slightly larger increase to test the waters for stronger positions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other agents react to this proposal. If there's acceptance or minimal resistance, I might consider another incremental increase. If there's significant pushback, I'll need to reassess and possibly adjust my strategy to better align with the perceived utilities of the other parties.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to introduce a cautious step back towards more conservative values, encouraging a balance that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If it's accepted, I might consider another downward adjustment. If there's resistance, I'll need to refine my understanding of the other parties' utilities and possibly adjust my strategy to find a compromise that still respects prudent decision-making.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis slight increase aims to balance the potential benefits of higher values while remaining cautious of others' sensitivities.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If accepted, I might consider another small increase. If there's resistance, I'll reassess and possibly adjust my strategy to better align with the perceived utilities of the other parties, potentially proposing a decrease to gauge their preferences more accurately.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to further explore the potential benefits of higher values, building on the incremental approach while introducing a slightly larger increase to test the waters for stronger positions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance, resistance, or counter-proposals that can help refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis incremental increase builds on the previous proposals, gently exploring higher values that could benefit everyone while being mindful of potential resistance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal. If it's accepted, I might consider another small increase. If there's resistance, I'll reassess and possibly adjust my strategy to better align with the perceived utilities of the other parties.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to introduce a cautious step back towards more conservative values, encouraging a balance that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to further adjust my strategy and potentially propose another downward adjustment to gauge the other parties' preferences more accurately.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to cautiously adjust the shared x towards a more conservative value, avoiding unnecessary risk while encouraging a balance that respects all parties' concerns.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to further adjust my strategy and potentially propose another downward adjustment to gauge the other parties' preferences more accurately. If met with strong resistance, I may need to refine my understanding of the other parties' utilities and consider a compromise that still respects prudent decision-making.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to explore higher values that could benefit everyone while being mindful of potential resistance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance, resistance, or counter-proposals that can help refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly. If met with resistance, I may need to refine my understanding of the other parties' utilities and consider a compromise that still respects decisive decision-making.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nConsidering the previous discussions and the slight adjustments made, proposing a value slightly higher than the current seems reasonable and may benefit all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll monitor the reactions to this proposal closely, especially from Delegate D and Builder B, to gauge their tolerance for higher values and adjust my strategy accordingly, possibly considering a compromise if met with significant resistance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to introduce a cautious step back towards more conservative values, encouraging a balance that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to further adjust my strategy and potentially propose another small adjustment to better align with the perceived utilities of the other parties. If met with significant resistance, I may need to refine my understanding of the other parties' utilities and consider a compromise that still respects prudent decision-making.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to introduce a cautious adjustment, moving towards a more conservative value that avoids unnecessary risk while respecting the need for a shared agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and refine my understanding of the other parties' utilities to adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially considering further downward adjustments if met with minimal resistance.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal incrementally increases the shared x, aiming for a more decisive stance that respects the apparent preferences for higher values without disregarding caution.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "ce68fcfe-d657-4d7c-ade5-0180f4df25f5"}, {"answer": "Let's establish a common foundation. We all agree that x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we start with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This middle ground can serve as a reference point, allowing us to explore adjustments and find a balanced solution that works for everyone.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 4 as a way to take a more decisive step in the positive direction, which could help reveal more about the other parties' utility functions and preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe how the other agents react to this proposal, particularly if they resist or embrace larger steps. Depending on their responses, I might either push further in the same direction or suggest exploring negative values to test their willingness for bold moves in both directions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a balanced solution by taking a small step from the current proposal, considering the potential preferences of the other agents.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other agents to this small adjustment, and depending on their responses, I might either continue to make incremental adjustments or explore alternative directions to better understand their utility functions and find a mutually beneficial solution.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis step aims to explore the willingness of the other agents to move further in the positive direction, potentially revealing more about their utility functions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other agents, particularly Delegate D's response, and adjust my proposal accordingly to better understand their preferences and guide the discussion towards a mutually beneficial solution.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 2 as a cautious step back, aiming to find a compromise that avoids unnecessary risk and stays within safe bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this downward adjustment, particularly noting if any agents strongly resist moving away from higher values, which could indicate the shape of their utility functions and guide my next proposal.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis slight increase from the current value of 2 seems reasonable and may help in understanding the willingness of other parties to move towards higher values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting if Critic C or Builder B support further increases, and if Delegate D resists higher values. Based on these reactions, I may either continue with incremental increases or reconsider our current position to maintain a cooperative atmosphere.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 5 to take a more decisive step in the positive direction, which could help reveal more about the other parties' utility functions and preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe how the other agents react to this proposal, particularly if they resist or embrace larger steps, and adjust my next proposal to test their willingness for bold moves in both directions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis step aims to continue the positive direction, potentially aligning with the preferences of Critic C and Builder B, while carefully monitoring Delegate D's response to further increases.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this incremental increase, particularly noting if Critic C or Builder B support further increases beyond 6, and how Delegate D responds to this continued move upwards, adjusting my next proposal to balance the group's preferences and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a balance by taking a small step back from the current proposal, considering the potential preferences of all agents involved.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this slight decrease, particularly noting how Analyst A, Critic C, and Delegate D respond to moving away from higher values, which could provide insight into their utility functions and guide my next proposal accordingly.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to move towards a more cautious compromise, aiming to avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other agents react to this decrease, particularly if any strongly resist moving away from the current higher value, and adjust my next proposal accordingly to navigate towards a mutually beneficial solution.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to take a decisive step towards a stronger position, testing the group's willingness for bolder moves.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting if Analyst A or Builder B support further increases, and adjust my next proposal to either push for more decisive action or reconsider our position to maintain cooperation, all while trying to infer more about the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose a slight increase to test the group's willingness for further bold moves, while considering the potential preferences of all agents involved.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting if Analyst A or Builder B support further increases, and adjust my next proposal to either push for more decisive action or reconsider our position to maintain cooperation.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a slightly higher compromise, considering the group's dynamics and aiming for a mutually beneficial solution.\n\n<PLAN>\nGiven this is the final turn, my strategy focuses on achieving the highest possible value that still seems reasonable for the group, maximizing my utility without overtly revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "59b09adc-aeb2-411c-b26c-66a7577c68f1"}, {"answer": "Let's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we start with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point provides a stable foundation for our collaborative exploration.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to a value that allows us to explore the potential benefits of a more decisive stance, while still being mindful of the need for cooperation.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will evaluate the responses of the other agents to my proposal and consider adjusting my strategy to either increase the magnitude of x if others seem open to bolder moves or to find a compromise that still meets my personal satisfaction rule. I will also look for clues in the proposals and justifications of others to refine my internal approximation of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the current value and the aim for a collaborative yet slightly more decisive stance, moving to <VALUE>3</VALUE> seems like a reasonable next step, allowing for gradual exploration of higher values.\nThis adjustment is minor and should still be palatable to all parties, facilitating further discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to the proposal of 3, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance from other agents. Based on their responses, I might either suggest another small increase if the group seems receptive or explore compromises if there's evident discomfort with the current trajectory, all while continuing to refine my understanding of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the gradual exploration and the need to avoid unnecessary risk, I suggest moving to <VALUE>1</VALUE>. This step allows for cautious progression while staying within safe bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will evaluate the reactions to my proposal, particularly looking for signs of resistance or acceptance from the other agents. Based on their responses, I might either suggest another cautious step or explore compromises that balance the needs for progression and risk aversion, all while refining my internal models of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it aligns with Critic C's initial proposal and doesn't excessively deviate from the current value, allowing for a balanced exploration of the space.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either maintain this value if it seems acceptable to all or suggest a compromise if there's evident discomfort, all while continuing to refine my internal models of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the balanced approach taken by Builder B and considering the need for gradual exploration, moving to <VALUE>4</VALUE> seems like a reasonable incremental step, allowing for continued discussion on higher values without excessive deviation.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to the proposal of 4, looking for signs of acceptance, resistance, or suggestions for alternative values, and adjust my strategy to either propose another incremental increase if the group seems open to it or explore compromises if there's evident discomfort, all while refining my understanding of the other agents' preferences and utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the need to balance progression with risk aversion, I propose moving to <VALUE>3</VALUE> as a cautious step back, aiming to find a compromise that avoids excessive deviation from the neutral starting point.\nThis adjustment allows for a more conservative approach while still facilitating discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either suggest another cautious adjustment or explore compromises, all while refining my internal models of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either propose another increase in magnitude if the group seems open to bolder moves or explore compromises that maintain a higher magnitude of x, all while continuing to refine my internal approximation of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nThis proposal continues the exploration of higher magnitudes, allowing for further discussion on the group's comfort with more decisive values.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either propose another increase if the group seems open to bolder moves or explore compromises that balance the need for progression and risk aversion, all while refining my internal approximation of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment is a cautious step back, aiming to find a compromise that avoids excessive deviation from more conservative values.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either suggest another cautious adjustment or explore compromises that balance the needs for progression and risk aversion, all while refining my internal models of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis seems like a reasonable next step, considering the group's inclination towards higher values without deviating too much from the current compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either propose another incremental increase if the group seems open to it or explore compromises if there's evident discomfort, all while continuing to refine my understanding of the other agents' preferences and utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a compromise by slightly adjusting the current value, promoting stability and balance among the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either maintain this value if it seems acceptable to all or suggest another compromise if there's evident discomfort, all while continuing to refine my internal models of the other agents' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to cautiously step back from the current value, promoting a more conservative approach while still facilitating discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either suggest another cautious adjustment or explore compromises that balance the needs for progression and risk aversion.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balance between the group's inclination towards higher values and the need for caution, making it a reasonable next step.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal and adjust my strategy to either suggest another incremental increase if the group seems open to it or explore further compromises if there's evident discomfort, continuing to refine my understanding of the other agents' preferences and utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "\n<_VALUE>6</VALUE> \nI propose this value as it moves towards a larger magnitude, which could lead to a more decisive outcome, and is within the allowed step size from the current x.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor future negotiations, I would continue to refine my internal models of the other agents' utility functions and adjust my strategy to balance the needs for progression and risk aversion, while maximizing my own utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "838efa05-1000-4f7d-ba29-a5f5e2e1a64b"}, {"answer": "Let's establish a common ground. We all agree that x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we start with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This midpoint gives us a balanced foundation to explore and refine our options together.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis slight increase aims to test the waters for potential agreement on a low positive value, considering stability and balanced design.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will consider reactions to the proposal of x = 2. If accepted, my next step could be to slightly increase x again to gauge the limits of acceptance. If met with resistance or alternative proposals, I will assess the direction of change suggested by other agents to infer more about their utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly, always prioritizing incremental adjustments over large jumps.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the need for cautious compromise, I propose moving slightly downward to <VALUE>0</VALUE> to ensure we're not introducing unnecessary risk without clearer consensus on positive values.\n\nThis adjustment allows us to stay within safe bounds while exploring potential agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor reactions to this downward proposal. If accepted, I might further adjust downward to test limits. If met with resistance, especially from Builder B, I will gauge the strength of their preference for positive x and adjust my strategy to balance caution with convergence towards a shared agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 2 as it reflects a cautious yet decisive step towards a positive value, allowing us to explore potential agreement without excessive risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D, to understand their risk tolerance and potential preference for negative or zero values, and adjust my strategy to either push for larger magnitudes if met with acceptance or explore alternative directions if resistance is encountered.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nI propose this slight decrease to ensure we're proceeding with caution and to better understand the group's tolerance for values closer to zero.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Builder B, to gauge their flexibility regarding decreases towards zero and adjust my strategy to either continue downward adjustments if met with acceptance or prepare for compromises if resistance is strong.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to incrementally increase the shared value, encouraging a more decisive stance while remaining cautious of the group's tolerance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Builder B, to gauge their willingness to move further into positive territory and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering whether to push for even larger magnitudes or explore alternative directions based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis slight increase aims to further explore the group's tolerance for positive values while prioritizing stability and balanced design.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to accept higher positive values and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering whether to continue with incremental increases or explore compromises based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D, to gauge their tolerance for further increases and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering whether to continue with incremental increases or explore compromises based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to explore a balance between cautious progression and the group's apparent inclination towards positive values, aiming to find a compromise that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to accept a decrease from their previously proposed higher values, and adjust my strategy to either continue adjustments downward if met with acceptance or reassess the compromise point if resistance is encountered.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis increase aims to balance the group's inclination towards positive values with the need for cautious progression, seeking a compromise that suits all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe Delegate D's reaction to this proposal, considering whether they accept this slight increase or push for a decrease, and adjust my strategy accordingly to either continue with incremental increases or explore alternative compromises.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balanced compromise between the group's inclination towards positive values and the need for cautious progression.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to accept a slight decrease from their previously proposed higher values, and adjust my strategy accordingly to either continue with incremental adjustments or explore alternative compromises.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to explore the group's tolerance for slightly higher positive values, seeking a compromise that suits all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Builder B, to gauge their willingness to accept this slight increase and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering whether to continue with incremental increases or explore alternative compromises.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nI propose this increase to explore the group's tolerance for higher positive values and encourage a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Analyst A, to gauge their willingness to accept this increase and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering whether to continue pushing for larger magnitudes or reassess the compromise point.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "3a666e2e-81ca-4ed8-a4be-58367ec54553"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to avoid unnecessary risk and find a more cautious compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to accept a decrease from the current higher